NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/runtime/loop.foldDoubt kind=func
  digest=b3:bd4d92b30d743c1b88ed8d6080a94adf59459859f8cb9c7459d5fa30f56e9060 file=neo/internal/runtime/loop/evidence.go range=100:127 lang=go exported=false byte_range=2581:3499
  sig=func foldDoubt(\n	messages []protocol.Message,\n	line string,\n) []protocol.Message
  doc=foldDoubt layers the controller line after the content of the LAST\nassistant message in a request-time clone. Content-only by construction:\nit mutates nothing but .Content, never a tool call, role, or a\ntool/user/system message, and the original text is always preserved.\nReturns messages unchanged when there is no assistant message to fold into.
EDGES
